{"availability":"available","full":"YauhenBichel/readme-contributors","name":"readme-contributors","description":"GitHub Action that draws a clickable contributors wall in your README: one polaroid card per person, bots omitted, no table. SVG layouts for Pages: facepile, grid, tiles, orbit, honeycomb.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-06T10:22:47Z","updated":"2026-10-11T08:23:34Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yauhenbichel.github.io/readme-contributors/","topics":["apache-2-0","avatars","community","composite-action","contributors","contributors-wall","documentation","facepile","github-action","github-actions","github-pages","open-source","polaroid","python","readme","readme-generator","svg","workflow"],"demo":"https://yauhenbichel.github.io/readme-contributors/#demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.119Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.119Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.119Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.800Z","stars":2,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:05.119Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Marketplace: readme-contributors · Site: yauhenbichel.github.io/readme-contributors","A GitHub Action that draws a contributors wall into your README: one clickable polaroid sticker per person (face plus name), plus SVG layouts for Pages (facepile, stickers, grid, tiles, orbit, honeycomb, and more). It reads the GitHub contributors API, adds the person who just landed and merged pull request authors (plus Co-authored-by trailers on those PRs) when that list is behind, omits bots, honors exclude, and replaces a pair of HTML markers. An empty wall writes “Be the first to appear here.” No , so GitHub does not draw a grid. No third-party list service.","GitHub cannot click a face inside one SVG. One picture is one link. A wall.svg with six heads looks clickable. It is not."